{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>Let it be magnified.</b> It is close to <i>long of patience</i>, for whoever is long of patience has great power to break his anger. And the proof: <i>as You spoke</i> — that You are long of patience. And these attributes I explained in the pericope of <i>Ki Tissa</i>."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:17:36.134987144Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}